    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from a sheep,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφθέραι</span>
			<i>sheep</i>-skins, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.58
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1027.13
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cos</span>): hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀέα</span> (q. v.) and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰίας</span> (with dial. change of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εα</span>- to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ία-</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: τῶν προβάτων τὰ σκεπαστήρια
			δέρματα</span> (<i>leather coats for sheep, brats</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Skt. <i>avyáyas,</i>
			Adj. from <i>ávis</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄϝις</span>
			 'sheep'.)</div>
